            lines {
              text: "- **Confirmed \342\200\224 Database & Backend Architecture**: Local SQLite with Express for the early prototype, isolated behind a clean Repository Layer and versioned REST API (`/api/v1`) so migrating to PostgreSQL / Cloud SQL and supporting future Android & iOS apps requires zero rewrite of UI or business logic."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
