            lines {
              text: "- **Confirmed \342\200\224 Localization Strategy**: English first with an **i18n-ready architecture** (centralized translation keys, locale-aware age/date formatters, and translation-ready curriculum fields) to support Hindi and regional Indian languages cleanly in future releases."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
