  planner_response {
    response: "The **LittleSteps Design System & UI Foundation (Step 1)** is implemented, verified, and live as the default visual reference page.\n\n### What Was Delivered\n\n- **Design Tokens & Typography**\n  - **Color Palette (WCAG 2.2 AA calibrated)**: Soft Sage Green primary (`#446E5A`, 5.7:1 contrast with white text), Warm Cream secondary (`#F6F1E7`), Off-White canvas (`#FAF9F6`), White cards (`#FFFFFF`), Muted Peach accent (`#E8B99B` / `#844825` ink), Soft Lavender highlight (`#D6CEE9` / `#4F4278` ink), Dark Charcoal text (`#222624`), and Muted Grey secondary text (`#5C635E`).\n  - **Typography Scale**: `Nunito` for warm, approachable page & section headings paired with `Plus Jakarta Sans` for crisp body/form legibility and `IBM Plex Mono` (`tabular-nums`) for percentages, dates, and ages across all seven hierarchy levels.\n  - **Accessibility & Motion**: Visible keyboard focus rings, semantic HTML landmarks, ARIA attributes (`aria-invalid`, `aria-describedby`, `aria-busy`, `aria-selected`, `aria-pressed`, `role=\"dialog\"`, `role=\"progressbar\"`, `aria-live=\"polite\"`), `>= 44px` touch targets, `320px+` zero-horizontal-scroll layout, and `prefers-reduced-motion` support.\n\n- **All 20 Reusable Components**\n  1. **Buttons** (`primary`, `secondary`, `subtle`, `danger`, loading & disabled states)\n  2. **Input fields** (labels, helper text, inline error states, disabled)\n  3. **Dropdowns (`Select`)**\n  4. **Date picker** (with automatic `0\342\200\22324 months` age-band preview)\n  5. **Navigation bar** (3-zone responsive top bar)\n  6. **Sidebar** (desktop workspace navigation)\n  7. **Mobile bottom navigation** (thumb-zone fixed bar on viewports under `768px` + inline preview)\n  8. **Cards** (single-elevation hairline surfaces across warm palette tones)\n  9. **Progress indicators** (linear bar and circular ring with tabular percentages)\n  10. **Badges** (restrained status and domain indicators with icons)\n  11. **Tabs** (keyboard arrow-navigable segmented tabs)\n  12. **Modal dialogs** (Escape/backdrop dismiss, bottom-sheet styling on mobile)\n  13. **Confirmation dialogs** (destructive and standard actions with loading state)\n  14. **Empty states**\n  15. **Loading skeletons** (text and card skeletons respecting reduced motion)\n  16. **Toast notifications** (`ToastProvider` + `useToast` live region)\n  17. **Video player** (supports both private signed video streams and step-paced demonstration chapters)\n  18. **Activity cards**\n  19. **Age-group selector** (all 8 canonical age bands `0\342\200\2233m` through `21\342\200\22324m`)\n  20. **Reusable page headers**\n\n- **Verification**\n  - Interactive **Design System Showcase** page is now displayed by default for your review.\n  - Automated component test suite passed (`7/7` tests), alongside clean strict TypeScript linting and production build verification.\n\nPlease review the Step 1 design system reference page and share any visual or component adjustments before we proceed to Step 2."
    message_id: "_X0Aa6GxIqjpz7IP36LaoA8"
