gable segmented tabs)\n  12. **Modal dialogs** (Escape/backdrop dismiss, bottom-sheet styling on mobile)\n  13. **Confirmation dialogs** (destructive and standard actions with loading state)\n  14. **Empty states**\n  15. **Loading skeletons** (text and card skeletons respecting reduced motion)\n  16. **Toast notifications** (`ToastProvider` + `useToast` live region)\n  17. **Video player** (supports both private signed video streams and step-paced demonstration chapters)\n  18. **Activity cards**\n  19. **Age-group selector** (all 8 canonical age bands `0\342\200\2233m` through `21\342\200\22324m`)\n  20. **Reusable page headers**\n\n- **Verification**\n  - Interactive **Design System Showcase** page is now displayed by default for your review.\n  - Automated component test suite passed (`7/7` tests), alongside clean strict TypeScript linting and production build verification.\n\nPlease review the Step 1 design system reference page and share any visual or component adjustments before we proceed to Step 2."
