              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "            LittleSteps provides structured, age-appropriate everyday play ideas and caregiver instruction coaching for parents of children aged 0\342\200\22324 months. LittleSteps is not a medical service, clinical therapy program, or developmental diagnostic tool. Always consult a qualified pediatrician regarding your child\342\200\231s health, nutrition, or developmental milestones."
