  planner_response {
    response: "The **LittleSteps public website (Step 2)** is built using the Step 1 design system, with history-backed client navigation across all nine pages and responsive desktop and mobile layouts.\n\n### What Was Built\n\n- **Landing Page (`/`) \342\200\224 All 9 Sections in Order**\n  1. **Hero**: `\"Little moments. Big milestones.\"` headline, concise relatable copy, `\"Start Your Journey\"` (`/register`) and `\"Explore How It Works\"` (`/how-it-works`) CTAs, paired with the sunlit mother-and-baby editorial visual.\n  2. **How It Works**: Three simple steps (*Choose your baby\342\200\231s age*, *Follow daily activities*, *Learn, practice, and track your journey*).\n  3. **Development Areas**: Six calm cards representing Cognitive, Language and Communication, Physical, Social and Emotional, Sensory, and Early Independence & Everyday Skills.\n  4. **Personalized Learning Journey**: Interactive 8-stage age-group selector (`0\342\200\2233m` through `21\342\200\22324m`) previewing how daily focus and everyday home objects adapt to each three-month band.\n  5. **Activity Demonstration**: Example *Household Texture Basket* preview featuring the step-paced video guide, duration, everyday household items, numbered instructions, and activity card.\n  6. **Progress & Achievements**: Non-judgmental daily completion, six-domain balance, and caregiver-only instruction-match coaching preview (no baby grades).\n  7. **Safety & Trust**: Transparent age-appropriateness, home safety notes, private 30-day auto-deleted video vault, and explicit non-diagnostic notice\342\200\224with zero invented testimonials, stats, certifications, or endorsements.\n  8. **Final CTA**: Warm invitation to create an account or sign in.\n  9. **Footer**: Navigation links, contact details (`hello@littlesteps.in`), Privacy Policy, Terms & Conditions, and a link back to the Step 1 Design System (`/design-system`).\n\n- **All Remaining Public Pages**\n  - **About LittleSteps (`/about`)**, **How It Works (`/how-it-works`)**, and **Our Approach (`/our-approach`)** explaining the calm daily rhythm, six domains, eight age stages, and caregiver-only rubric philosophy.\n  - **Contact Us (`/contact`)** with validated form submission persisted to SQLite (`POST /api/v1/contact`) and instant reference confirmation.\n  - **Privacy Policy (`/privacy`)** and **Terms & Conditions (`/terms`)** detailing private child video handling, 30-day automatic deletion, instant parent deletion, and non-diagnostic scope.\n  - **Login (`/login`)** and **Register (`/register`)** built with Step 1 form controls and connected to live authentication (plus quick prototype workspace sign-in buttons on Login).\n\n- **Verification**\n  - Strict TypeScript linting, production Vite build, `7/7` design system component tests, and the live Contact API endpoint all passed cleanly."
    message_id: "yX8Aa-DeL8WZkdUP_IT1-Qo"
