      text: "<clarifying-answers>\nQ: Which database architecture should power LittleSteps?\nA: Local SQLite with Express for early prototype\nQ: What retention policy should apply to uploaded baby activity videos?\nA: Private access with 30-day auto-deletion\nQ: Which localization approach should we build into the first version?\nA: English first with i18n-ready architecture\nQ: Which visual design direction best fits LittleSteps?\nA: Warm calm Montessori editorial\n</clarifying-answers>"
