    combined_output {
      full: "TAP version 13# Subtest: Design tokens cover all 8 required color roles and 7 typography levelsok 1 - Design tokens cover all 8 required color roles and 7 typography levels  ---  duration_ms: 1.244286  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: Button renders primary, loading (aria-busy), and disabled statesok 2 - Button renders primary, loading (aria-busy), and disabled states  ---  duration_ms: 11.651484  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: Input, Select, and DatePicker wire WCAG error alerts and baby age previewok 3 - Input, Select, and DatePicker wire WCAG error alerts and baby age preview  ---  duration_ms: 5.710518  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: AgeGroupSelector renders all 8 canonical age groups with aria-pressedok 4 - AgeGroupSelector renders all 8 canonical age groups with aria-pressed  ---  duration_ms: 1.28394  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: ProgressIndicator renders WCAG progressbar role and clamped aria valuesok 5 - ProgressIndicator renders WCAG progressbar role and clamped aria values  ---  duration_ms: 1.938085  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: Tabs, Modal, ConfirmDialog, and Badges expose accessible semanticsok 6 - Tabs, Modal, ConfirmDialog, and Badges expose accessible semantics  ---  duration_ms: 3.969401  type: \'test\'  ...# Subtest: Navigation, Cards, VideoPlayer, ActivityCard, EmptyState, Skeleton, and PageHeader render cleanlyok 7 - Navigation, Cards, VideoPlayer, ActivityCard, EmptyState, Skeleton, and PageHeader render cleanly  ---  duration_ms: 9.808813  type: \'test\'  ...1..7# tests 7# suites 0# pass 7# fail 0# cancelled 0# skipped 0# todo 0# duration_ms 794.679134ALL STEP 3 END-TO-END AUTH, ONBOARDING & SECURITY ISOLATION CHECKS PASSED!"
