  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying End-to-End Functionality**\n\nI\'m currently automating a verification process for the Step 4 Parent Dashboard API layer and design system. I\'ll start by signing in as the demo parent, `meera@littlesteps.in`. My immediate focus is to verify the `GET /api/v1/journey/ch_aarav_01/today` endpoint\'s functionality. This is a crucial step in ensuring that the dashboard API performs as expected.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "VPcAa5rXH__WjMcP1bmAsQ0"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_125562376615285172"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"npx tsx --test src/design-system/__tests__/designSystem.test.tsx && node -e \'\\nconst BASE = \\\"http://localhost:3000/api/v1\\\";\\n\\nasync function req(path, opts = {}, cookie = \\\"\\\") {\\n  const headers = { ...(opts.headers || {}) };\\n  if (cookie) headers[\\\"Cookie\\\"] = cookie;\\n  const res = await fetch(`${BASE}${path}`, { ...opts, headers });\\n  const setCookie = res.headers.get(\\\"set-cookie\\\");\\n  const nextCookie = setCookie ? setCookie.split(\\\";\\\")[0] : cookie;\\n  const body = await res.json();\\n  return { status: res.status, body, cookie: nextCookie };\\n}\\n\\nfunction assert(cond, msg) {\\n  if (!cond) { console.error(\\\"FAIL:\\\", msg); process.exit(1); }\\n}\\n\\n(async () => {\\n  // 1. Login as demo parent Meera\\n  const login = await req(\\\"/auth/login\\\", {\\n    method: \\\"POST\\\",\\n    headers: { \\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\" },\\n    body: JSON.stringify({ email: \\\"meera@littlesteps.in\\\", password: \\\"LittleSteps123!\\\" }),\\n  });\\n  assert(login.status === 200, `login failed: ${login.status}`);\\n  const cookie = login.cookie;\\n\\n  // 2. Fetch enriched Today journey for Aarav\\n  const j1 = await req(\\\"/journey/ch_aarav_01/today\\\", { method: \\\"GET\\\" }, cookie);\\n  assert(j1.status === 200, `journey failed: ${j1.status}`);\\n  const d = j1.body;\\n  assert(d.todaySummary && typeof d.todaySummary.completionPct === \\\"number\\\", \\\"missing todaySummary\\\");\\n  assert(d.todaySummary.totalTodayCount === 3, `expected 3 activities in Day 1, got ${d.todaySummary.totalTodayCount}`);\\n  assert(Array.isArray(d.weeklyProgress) && d.weeklyProgress.length === 7, \\\"weeklyProgress must have 7 days\\\");\\n  assert(Array.isArray(d.domainProgress) && d.domainProgress.length === 6, \\\"domainProgress must have 6 domains\\\");\\n  assert(d.domainProgress.every((x) => x.availableCount >= 1), \\\"each domain must have availableCount >= 1\\\");\\n  assert(d.parentingTip && d.parentingTip.ageGroupSlug === \\\"6-9m\\\", \\\"parentingTip must match 6-9m\\\");\\n  assert(Array.isArray(d.notifications) && d.notifications.length >= 1, \\\"notifications should reflect real data\\\");\\n\\n  // 3. Test starting an activity does not downgrade an already reviewed activity\\n  const reviewedItem = d.items.find((i) => i.completion?.status === \\\"reviewed\\\");\\n  assert(reviewedItem, \\\"expected seeded reviewed item on Day 1\\\");\\n  const startReviewed = await req(\\\"/completions\\\", {\\n    method: \\\"POST\\\",\\n    headers: { \\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\" },\\n    body: JSON.stringify({ childId: \\\"ch_aarav_01\\\", activityId: reviewedItem.activity.id, status: \\\"started\\\" }),\\n  }, cookie);\\n  assert(startReviewed.status === 201 && startReviewed.body.completion.status === \\\"reviewed\\\", \\\"started must not downgrade reviewed\\\");\\n\\n  // 4. Test published activities library endpoints\\n  const lib = await req(\\\"/activities\\\", { method: \\\"GET\\\" }, cookie);\\n  assert(lib.status === 200 && lib.body.activities.length >= 10, \\\"activities library should list published activities\\\");\\n  const detail = await req(`/activities/${lib.body.activities[0].id}`, { method: \\\"GET\\\" }, cookie);\\n  assert(detail.status === 200 && detail.body.activity.steps.length > 0, \\\"activity detail should return steps\\\");\\n\\n  console.log(\\\"ALL STEP 4 PARENT DASHBOARD DATA LAYER CHECKS PASSED!\\\");\\n})();\\n\'\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Running Step 4 dashboard and unit verification tests\", \"toolSummary\":\"Run Step 4 verification suite\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\202\t\n\377\b\001i\024}\023\354k\226E\035\006\202E\003*\331\240\362\341xM\271\0333\230\320\341\265\376\377\302Vt\205>wb&5\001\"\227\024\363H\331\352\304\017\201\204\277\373\224\261#\f\006\033O\327H\2253 \234\370\005\372\306T\352\235 \340\334\324\032\304\224M\237(\247/\307$\025\211\267C\036n\310\3042\330\\\227\375\227\323\006\242\004?\025w\243q\321\005\355\016{;y\264\207\240D\307c\033Eq6|\362\032)\250(a\334L\272\v\354\221\343g\325\272\001 \271\316=\266\3235\214c\247Z\355\244\370\325d@\373\362\022\225\255N\277\r\325\361\341\315\375\222k\275ggwbPzb201,\n6\264\320LE6\022`\2022\256\a\0209\234\033\254\362v\204\273\373\233z\200\321\301\360\374\2205&k\322s\020\265\366\017\335\2075\331+Y2X4\312tZ\307\244f\377\244\204(\3340\346\314\036F\r*@\255\332\266\225\2401)0\311\200\234g\265\233\fd$\314\220\"\344\212\325\363\377\324\332\236\203{\322\336\373\032(\304\023\222\315QYn\223\312v\234X\355\002\020sNf\245\355\317?\002<\2013\270n\313\3177s\210\264\346\222,JZ\232\216\350N\316ks\341\272\224$\035\017\263L\206\240W\262\202N\374\035\253)\331\222\323\304\016\211\324\033\337$>&\016x\270^H\r\2223o%\020\344!\314i\261\234\236\253\326\377\201\350\226\206\024\b!=\003foc-X-\202l\034]NC\245\020\256\251Dd&\031\205\362\221\']\363\b\261V\270]\263PO\345O\016\356K\224\201%\323\226\324\335\205Q\332v\370\246I\250#\'\004\364\203M\356\306\232Z\020\326\233\346\002\243p\253\315\225\244\n\327L\3550$T\304\2402\326\322o_Dd\214\247\374\263\003*X\341\3560+\347p\222\034sK;%\351\366\335~\343\342^/O#\360m\315\177A\234{\223#\251\367\224\036S\310\253\f\370\315\305\337r\205e59c\036\211\022\214\'\266\372U0\333t\335\360\024\016\030D~s\263\353\026\033\370\253\341\255\330\260\325\217E<:\a|Y\027\334I\227\232\361\315\273\373\364\272_I\331\327H\214\267V%Qt\310\202\302n\017\330\204\213\367\210\273\025F\037\235i\267V\347\202r\243d\270`\357\257\241\223 \033\034\204:h\201\002\270ek\365\271\256\272\314\035\240\310\233t8\365c`\027c\006\243@/l~\004;\006\247\266\003\233v\030u\352L\177\025\211\332=\0