  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Integrating Daily Plans**\n\nI\'ve realized I can streamline the database setup. Now, I plan to integrate `ensureStructuredDailyPlans(db)` directly within `seedDatabaseIfEmpty(db)`. This approach ensures that daily plans are properly structured whether the database is new or already contains data, and that this idempotent function is run after any seeding.\n\n\n**Planning Batch Execution**\n\nI\'m structuring the next execution step as two batches. Batch 1 will focus on shared types, the SQLite schema, multi-day curriculum seeding (idempotent), repository business rules, and API implementation. I am adding a new `ActivityPrepLevel` with types for activities and will be sure to add `prepLevel` to existing types. I plan to add `JourneyDisplayStatus` and corresponding status indicators. I am also working on `UpcomingPlanDay` and `CompletedHistoryItem`.\n\n\n**Adding New Schema Fields**\n\nI\'m now integrating several new fields into the `TodayJourneyResponse`. Specifically, I\'m adding `learningWeek`, `upcomingDays`, `completedHistory`, and `inProgressItems`. I\'m also preparing for the schema migrations. I will ensure all previous activity completions records receive snapshots for `age_group_id` and `age_group_label`. Finally, I\'ll update the database seed to ensure that new activity completions include snapshot values.\n\n\n**Refining Business Rules**\n\nI am now focusing on refining the business rules. I am ensuring that I enforce a strict age-group filter in the `getJourneyForChild` function and also deduplicating `activityIds` in `upsertDailyPlan`. I\'ve added a new business rule to prevent unexpected duplicates. I\'ve also incorporated thoughtful `prep_level` (`no_prep`, `quick_setup`, `guided_prep`) to every activity. Finally, I\'m developing six domains across Days 1\342\200\2233 without duplicating any activity.\n\n\n**Implementing Display Status**\n\nI am integrating a new approach for managing activity display status. Specifically, I\'m developing the `resolveEffectiveDisplayStatus` helper to determine if something should be \'reviewed,\' \'submitted_for_review,\' \'completed,\' \'in_progress,\' or \'not_started.\' It will correctly handle legacy data. I am also updating `upsertActivityCompletion` to only allow the storage of a status of \'reviewed\' through the correct path. I\'ll snapshot `age_group_id_snapshot` and `age_group_label_snapshot` on insert.\n\n\n**Preventing Unwanted Overwrites**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing data integrity. `updateChild` will exclusively modify the `children` table, never touching historical activity data. I\'m building `listCompletedHistoryForChild` to provide a complete, ordered record of completions, even from previous age groups. I\'m also preparing `getUpcomingDaysForChild`, carefully filtering plan days by `child.activeAgeGroupId` and ensuring realistic projected dates, and now calculating the `learningWeek` cleanly from the child\'s age or stage.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "cAEBa6WYE4m_qtsPxpW9-Aw"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_13481422133758296409"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Add Step 5 structured daily journey types including prepLevel, 5-state displayStatus, learningWeek, upcomingDays, and historical completedHistory\", \"EndLine\":230, \"Instruction\":\"Extend shared types for Step 5 My Plan requirements and strict business rules\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"export type ActivityPrepLevel = \'no_prep\' | \'quick_setup\' | \'guided_prep\';\\n\\nexport type JourneyDisplayStatus =\\n  | \'not_started\'\\n  | \'in_progress\'\\n  | \'completed\'\\n  | \'submitted_for_review\'\\n  | \'reviewed\';\\n\\nexport interface ActivitySummary {\\n  id: string;\\n  ageGroupId: string;\\n  ageGroupSlug: string;\\n  ageGroupLabel: string;\\n  domainId: string;\\n  domainSlug: string;\\n  domainName: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  summary: string;\\n  durationMinutes: number;\\n  prepLevel: ActivityPrepLevel;\\n  materials: string[];\\n  safetyNotes: string;\\n  instructionalPosterUrl: string;\\n  status: ActivityStatus;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ActivityDetail extends ActivitySummary {\\n  steps: ActivityStep[];\\n  rubricCriteria: ActivityRubricCriterion[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ReviewRubricScoreDetail {\\n  id: string;\\n  criterionId: string;\\n  criterionLabel: string;\\n  criterionDescription: string;\\n  achievedLevel: RubricAchievementLevel;\\n  earnedPoints: number;\\n  maxPoints: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SubmissionReviewDetail {\\n  id: string;\\n  submissionId: string;\\n  reviewerUserId: string;\\n  reviewerName: string;\\n  instructionMatchScorePct: number;\\n  strengthsNote: string;\\n  coachingTip: string;\\n  evaluationScopeAcknowledgedAt: string;\\n  submittedAt: string;\\n  rubricScores: ReviewRubricScoreDetail[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface VideoSubmissionSummary {\\n  id: string;\\n  completionId: string;\\n  childId: string;\\n  activityId: string;\\n  activityTitle: string;\\n  domainName: string;\\n  ageGroupLabel: string;\\n  mimeType: string;\\n  fileSizeBytes: number;\\n  durationSeconds: number;\\n  reviewStatus: SubmissionReviewStatus;\\n  hasActiveVideo: boolean;\\n  expiresAt: string;\\n  deletedAt: string | null;\\n  deletionReason: string | null;\\n  caregiverNotes: string | null;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n  review: SubmissionReviewDetail | null;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface JourneyActivityItem {\\n  planItemId: string;\\n  sortOrder: number;\\n  activity: ActivityDetail;\\n  displayStatus: JourneyDisplayStatus;\\n  completion: {\\n    id: string;\\n    status: CompletionStatus;\\n    caregiverNotes: string | null;\\n    completedAt: string | null;\\n  } | null;\\n  latestSubmission: VideoSubmissionSummary | null;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface UpcomingPlanDay {\\n  dayNumber: number;\\n  title: string;\\n  focusNote: string;\\n  scheduledDate: string;\\n  activities: ActivitySummary[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface CompletedHistoryItem {\\n  completionId: string;\\n  activityId: string;\\n  activityTitle: string;\\n  domainName: string;\\n  domainSlug: string;\\n  durationMinutes: number;\\n  prepLevel: ActivityPrepLevel;\\n  planDate: string;\\n  completedAt: string;\\n  caregiverNotes: string | null;\\n  ageGroupIdSnapshot: string;\\n  ageGroupLabelSnapshot: string;\\n  displayStatus: JourneyDisplayStatus;\\n  reviewScorePct: number | null;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface DomainProgressStat {\\n  domainId: string;\\n  domainSlug: string;\\n  domainName: string;\\n  completedCount: number;\\n  availableCount: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface WeeklyProgressDay {\\n  date: string;\\n  dayLabel: string;\\n  completedCount: number;\\n  isToday: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface LastActivityResume {\\n  activity: ActivityDetail;\\n  status: CompletionStatus;\\n  displayStatus: JourneyDisplayStatus;\\n  updatedAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ParentingTip {\\n  id: string;\\n  ageGroupSlug: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  body: string;\\n  focusArea: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ParentNotificationItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  kind: \'review_ready\' | \'submission_queued\' | \'email_verify\' | \'daily_rhythm\';\\n  title: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n  actionLabel?: string;\\n  targetSection?: \'today\' | \'my-plan\' | \'activities\' | \'progress\' | \'verify-email\';\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TodayJourneyResponse {\\n  child: ChildProfile;\\n  learningWeek: {\\n    weekNumber: number;\\n    totalStageWeeks: number;\\n    stageLabel: string;\\n    todayDateIso: string;\\n  };\\n  availableDays: Array<{ dayNumber: number; title: string; focusNote: string }>;\\n  selectedDay: {\\n    id: string;\\n    dayNumber: number;\\n    title: string;\\n    focusNote: string;\\n  };\\n  todaySummary: {\\n    completedTodayCount: number;\\n    totalTodayCount: number;\\n    completionPct: number;\\n  };\\n  items: JourneyActivityItem[];\\n  upcomingDays: UpcomingPlanDay[];\\n  inProgressItems: JourneyActivityItem[];\\n  completedHistory: CompletedHistoryItem[];\\n  weeklyProgress: WeeklyProgressDay[];\\n  domainProgress: DomainProgressStat[];\\n  lastActivity: LastActivityResume | null;\\n  parentingTip: ParentingTip;\\n  notifications: ParentNotificationItem[];\\n  recentSubmissions: VideoSubmissionSummary[];\\n}\", \"StartLine\":99, \"TargetContent\":\"export interface ActivitySummary {\\n  id: string;\\n  ageGroupId: string;\\n  ageGroupSlug: string;\\n  ageGroupLabel: string;\\n  domainId: string;\\n  domainSlug: string;\\n  domainName: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  summary: string;\\n  durationMinutes: number;\\n  materials: string[];\\n  safetyNotes: string;\\n  instructionalPosterUrl: string;\\n  status: ActivityStatus;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ActivityDetail extends ActivitySummary {\\n  steps: ActivityStep[];\\n  rubricCriteria: ActivityRubricCriterion[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ReviewRubricScoreDetail {\\n  id: string;\\n  criterionId: string;\\n  criterionLabel: string;\\n  criterionDescription: string;\\n  ac