  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Building Parallel Files**\n\nI\'m now focused on constructing the remaining Step 5 files simultaneously, aiming for clean, parallel implementation. Currently, I\'m working on `/src/design-system/ActivityCard.tsx` and adding backward-compatible optional props like `prepLevelLabel?` for inline display in the quiet unstyled mode. The goal is a seamless addition without breaking existing functionality.\n\n\n**Defining Status Display**\n\nI\'m now integrating the `statusState` prop and its visual representation into the design. I\'m focusing on a clean, visual differentiation across the five states, avoiding harsh colors or clutter. For example, \'not_started\' uses a neutral palette, while \'in_progress\' gets a warm peach accent with a \'PlayCircle\' icon. Each state gets a button too, such as `Start Activity` or `Resume Activity`.\n\n\n**Designing Plan Overview**\n\nI\'m now designing the \"My Plan\" page at `/src/pages/parent/MyPlanSection.tsx`, a structured daily learning journey. It begins with a header card for baby\'s age and learning week, followed by a completion progress indicator. I\'m also including a banner to resume unfinished activities when they exist. I\'m aiming for an easy-to-read layout.\n\n\n**Constructing Activity Tabs**\n\nI\'m now implementing the tabbed navigation for the \"My Plan\" page. I\'m focusing on \"Today\'s Activities,\" \"Upcoming Days,\" and \"Completed History\" using our Design System `Tabs` component. The \"Today\'s Activities\" tab will include a day switcher, a focus note, and a domain coverage strip. I\'m also working on visually distinct `ActivityCard`s, each with contextual CTAs and a compact status key.\n\n\n**Implementing History Displays**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the \"Completed History\" tab. I am working on the chronological display of past activities, including historical stage snapshots and completion details. The goal is to provide a comprehensive, yet easily digestible, record of the baby\'s learning journey, preserving all past milestones. I\'m also ensuring a reassuring note about age updates and plan refreshes.\n\n\n**Balancing Plan Areas**\n\nI\'m now restructuring the daily learning journey to evenly balance all six development areas over the week, not just cramming them into a single day. I\'m using calm editorial framing to assure easy-to-follow, age-appropriate activities. I\'m updating `/src/pages/ParentDashboardView.tsx`, integrating `prepLevelLabel`, and ensuring full history with `completedActivityIds`. I\'m also ensuring a duplication check in the server.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "PwMBa_nvEPWhz7IPqfTTyQs"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1958060948386237717"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Enhance ActivityCard with optional preparation level metadata and distinct Montessori visual styling for all 5 journey activity states while preserving full backward compatibility.\", \"EndLine\":88, \"Instruction\":\"Add optional prepLevelLabel and statusState props to ActivityCard with distinct visual styling and icons for not_started, in_progress, completed, submitted_for_review, and reviewed states.\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { Award, CheckCircle2, CircleDashed, Clock, PlayCircle, UploadCloud } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { EditorialImage } from \'../components/EditorialImage\';\\nimport type { JourneyDisplayStatus } from \'../shared/types\';\\nimport { Badge, type BadgeTone } from \'./Badge\';\\nimport { Button } from \'./Button\';\\n\\nexport interface ActivityCardProps {\\n  title: string;\\n  summary: string;\\n  domainName: string;\\n  ageGroupLabel: string;\\n  durationMinutes: number;\\n  prepLevelLabel?: string;\\n  materials: string[];\\n  posterUrl: string;\\n  statusText: string;\\n  statusTone?: BadgeTone;\\n  statusState?: JourneyDisplayStatus;\\n  completed?: boolean;\\n  actionLabel?: string;\\n  onAction: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nconst STATE_STYLES: Record<\\n  JourneyDisplayStatus,\\n  {\\n    articleClass: string;\\n    topStripeClass: string;\\n    badgeTone: BadgeTone;\\n    buttonVariant: \'primary\' | \'secondary\';\\n    icon: React.ReactNode;\\n  }\\n> = {\\n  not_started: {\\n    articleClass: \'border-border bg-surface\',\\n    topStripeClass: \'bg-border/60\',\\n    badgeTone: \'neutral\',\\n    buttonVariant: \'primary\',\\n    icon: <CircleDashed className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />,\\n  },\\n  in_progress: {\\n    articleClass: \'border-peach bg-peach-soft/20\',\\n    topStripeClass: \'bg-peach-ink/70\',\\n    badgeTone: \'peach\',\\n    buttonVariant: \'primary\',\\n    icon: <PlayCircle className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />,\\n  },\\n  completed: {\\n    articleClass: \'border-sage-border bg-sage-soft/25\',\\n    topStripeClass: \'bg-sage\',\\n    badgeTone: \'sage\',\\n    buttonVariant: \'secondary\',\\n    icon: <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />,\\n  },\\n  submitted_for_review: {\\n    articleClass: \'border-lavender bg-lavender-soft/35\',\\n    topStripeClass: \'bg-lavender-ink/75\',\\n    badgeTone: \'lavender\',\\n    buttonVariant: \'secondary\',\\n    icon: <UploadCloud className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />,\\n  },\\n  reviewed: {\\n    articleClass: \'border-sage bg-sage-soft/45\',\\n    topStripeClass: \'bg-sage\',\\n    badgeTone: \'sage\',\\n    buttonVariant: \'secondary\',\\n    icon: <Award className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />,\\n  },\\n};\\n\\nexport function ActivityCard({\\n  title,\\n  summary,\\n  domainName,\\n  ageGroupLabel,\\n  durationMinutes,\\n  prepLevelLabel,\\n  materials,\\n  posterUrl,\\n  statusText,\\n  statusTone,\\n  statusState,\\n  completed = false,\\n  actionLabel = \'Open Guide\',\\n  onAction,\\n}: ActivityCardProps) {\\n  const stateVisual = statusState ? STATE_STYLES[statusState] : null;\\n  const resolvedTone: BadgeTone = statusTone ?? stateVisual?.badgeTone ?? \'neutral\';\\n  const resolvedIcon = stateVisual ? (\\n    stateVisual.icon\\n  ) : completed ? (\\n    <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n  ) : (\\n    <Clock className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n  );\\n  const resolvedButtonVariant = stateVisual?.buttonVariant ?? \'primary\';\\n\\n  return (\\n    <article\\n      data-status={statusState ?? (completed ? \'completed\' : \'not_started\')}\\n      className={`rounded-xl border overflow-hidden flex flex-col transition-colors ${\\n        stateVisual ? stateVisual.articleClass : \'border-border bg-surface\'\\n      }`}\\n    >\\n      {stateVisual && (\\n        <div\\n          aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n          className={`h-1 w-full shrink-0 ${stateVisual.topStripeClass}`}\\n        />\\n      )}\\n\\n      <EditorialImage\\n        src={posterUrl}\\n        alt={title}\\n        aspectClassName=\\\"aspect-[16/10]\\\"\\n      />\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"p-5 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n          {/* Quiet unboxed metadata line */}\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed\\\">\\n            {domainName} <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span> {ageGroupLabel}{\' \'}\\n            <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>{\' \'}\\n            <span className=\\\"font-mono tabular-nums\\\">{durationMinutes} min</span>\\n            {prepLevelLabel && (\\n              <>\\n                {\' \'}\\n                <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span> <span>{prepLevelLabel}</span>\\n              </>\\n            )}\\n          </p>\\n\\n          <h3 className=\\\"font-display text-xl font-semibold text-charcoal leading-snug\\\">\\n            {title}\\n          </h3>\\n\\n          <p className=\\\"text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed\\\">{summary}</p>\\n\\n          {materials.length > 0 && (\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-muted pt-1\\\">\\n              Materials:{\' \'}\\n              <span className=\\\"text-charcoal\\\">{materials.slice(0, 3).join(\', \')}</span>\\n            </p>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"pt-3.5 border-t border-border/80 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n          <Badge tone={resolvedTone} icon={resolvedIcon}>\\n            {statusText}\\n          </Badge>\\n\\n          <Button variant={resolvedButtonVariant} size=\\\"sm\\\" onClick={onAction}>\\n            {actionLabel}\\n          </Button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </article>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"StartLine\":1, \"TargetContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport { CheckCircle2, Clock } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { EditorialImage } from \'../components/EditorialImage\';\\nimport { Badge, type BadgeTone } from \'./Badge\';\\nimport { Button } from \'./Button\';\\n\\nexport interface ActivityCardProps {\\n  title: string;\\n  summary: string;\\n  domainName: string;\\n  ageGroupLabel: string;\\n  durationMinutes: number;\\n  materials: string[];\\n  posterUrl: string;\\n  statusText: string;\\n  statusTone?: BadgeTone;\\n  completed?: boolean;\\n  actionLabel?: string;\\n  onAction: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport function ActivityCard({\\n  title,\\n  summary,\\n  domainName,\\n  ageGroupLabel,\\n  durationMinutes,\\n  materials,\\n  posterUrl,\\n  statusText,\\n  statusTone = \'neutral\',\\n  completed = false,\\n  actionLabel = \'Open Guide\',\\n  onAction,\\n}: ActivityCardProps) {\\n  return (\\n    <article className=\\\"rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\">\\n      <EditorialImage\\n        src={posterUrl}\\n        alt={title}\\n        aspectClassName=\\\"aspect-[16/10]\\\"\\n      />\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"p-5 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n          {/* Quiet unboxed metadata line */}\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-muted\\\">\\n            {domainName} <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span> {ageGroupLabel}{\' \'}\\n            <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>{\' \'}\\n            <span className=\\\"font-mono tabular-nums\\\">{durationMinutes} min</span>\\n          </p>\\n\\n          <h3 className=\\\"font-display text-xl font-semibold text-charcoal leading-snug\\\">\\n            {title}\\n          </h3>\\n\\n          <p className=\\\"text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed\\\">{summary}</p>\\n\\n          {materials.length > 0 && (\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-muted pt-1\\\">\\n              At home: <span className=\\\"text-charc