    thinking: "**Discovering E2E Error**\n\nI\'m thrilled with the E2E test\'s immediate catch! It highlighted a significant discrepancy in domain representation within multi-day plans. While all seven Design System unit tests passed, the error indicates a mismatch between the expected and received domains. The test showed a specific list: sensory, cognitive, language, physical, early-independence. This live verification is proving invaluable!\n\n\n"
