  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Dashboard**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the frontend design. My goal is a Montessori Progress & Activity History dashboard. I\'m prioritizing simple charts, clear progress indicators, engaging illustrations, descriptive labels, and user-friendly empty states. I\'m consulting relevant resources for system-level skills.\n\n\n**Reviewing Existing Design**\n\nI\'ve circled back to the established LittleSteps design system, realizing we already have the building blocks. I\'m focusing now on integrating these components\342\200\224`Card`, `Badge`, etc.\342\200\224to create the Montessori dashboard. I\'m planning a clean authenticated `GET /api/v1/progress/:childId` endpoint, too. I\'m currently reviewing the frontend design files to determine how to best integrate the existing data and routing.\n\n\n"
