  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Project Design**\n\nI\'m focusing on the frontend design now, aiming to create a user-friendly Montessori-editorial Admin Dashboard. My current plan involves nine modules with key features like searchable, sortable, paginated tables, filters, confirmation dialogs, and content preview. I\'m prioritizing clean, clear typography for the tabular data.\n\n\n**Reviewing Architecture and Design**\n\nI\'m now integrating the Saas dashboard reference into the admin interface. I\'m focusing on dense data tables and applying this style to existing admin files and the database schema. I\'m checking existing files and schema to apply the Saas dashboard design to age groups, learning domains, and activities.\n\n\n"
