  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 3
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\nWe are building **LittleSteps**, a parenting and early-childhood development web platform (0\342\200\22324 months, India-first, global-ready) using React + Vite + Tailwind CSS v4 + Express (`/api/v1`) + SQLite (`better-sqlite3`, WAL mode, foreign keys ON), styled in a warm, calm Montessori editorial design system.\n\nCompleted and E2E-verified previous steps:\n- **Steps 0\342\200\2237**: Design System (`/src/design-system/*`), 9-page public website, auth + 6-screen parent onboarding, responsive Parent Dashboard, structured daily learning journey (`My Plan`), caregiver video recording/upload workflow with private storage disclosure and 30-day retention.\n- **Step 8 (DONE & E2E VERIFIED)**: Reviewer Dashboard & 4-level weighted rubric evaluation workbench (`/src/pages/ReviewerWorkbenchView.tsx`), exact server-side formula `(Earned / Applicable) \303\227 100` excluding `not_assessable`, draft/publish/edit/not_assessable/request-changes flows, immutable `review_audit_history`, strict reviewer assignment RBAC (`403`), and updated parent result view.\n- **Step 9 (DONE & E2E VERIFIED)**: Parent Progress Tracking & Activity History (`/src/pages/parent/ProgressDashboardSection.tsx`, `GET /api/v1/progress/:childId`), custom Montessori watercolor illustration (`/src/assets/images/progress_journey_illustration_1795236568060.jpg`), 6 participation metrics, weekly bar chart + 4-week gentle rhythm, 6-domain participation bars, 4-filter Activity History (date range, domain, completion status, review status) opening activity details & related review modal, and complete Review History tab.\n\n**CURRENT TASK \342\200\224 STEP 10 (IN PROGRESS): Build the LittleSteps Admin Dashboard**\nBuild a complete, working 9-module admin interface to manage the platform without modifying application code:\n1. **Dashboard**: Total parents, Total children, Total activities (published/draft/archived), Pending reviews, Completed reviews, Recent platform activity, plus 8\303\2276 curriculum coverage matrix.\n2. **Age Group Management**: Manage the 8 age groups (edit label, min/max months, sort order, view activity & child counts).\n3. **Development Domain Management**: Manage the 6 development domains (edit name, description, sort order, view activity counts).\n4. **Activity Management**: Create, edit, archive, delete activities; assign age group & domain; add **objectives**, duration, prep level, materials, step-by-step instructions, **poster & optional instructional video URL**, safety guidelines, and weighted rubric criteria (sum = 100); support `draft` / `published` / `archived` states; **Preview before publishing**; **Content Versioning** (updating an activity or rubric creates a new version, preserves previous versions in `activity_versions`, and keeps existing `video_submissions` linked to the exact `activity_version` used when submitted).\n5. **Daily Plan Management**: Create, edit, and delete daily learning plans per age group.\n6. **Reviewer Management**: Manage reviewer accounts and permissions (create/provision reviewer accounts, toggle active/suspended, set permitted age groups & specialty notes, view workload stats).\n7. **Submission Management**: View all submission records and statuses (searchable, sortable, filterable, paginated), assign/reassign reviewers, inspect details, delete video with confirmation, run 30-day retention sweep.\n8. **User Management**: Manage parent, reviewer, and admin accounts (search, sort, filter, paginate, change roles, toggle active/inactive with self-lockout and last-admin protection).\n9. **Audit Logs**: Track administrative actions (`admin_audit_logs`), review actions (`review_audit_history`), and media privacy access logs (`media_access_audit_logs`) in a unified searchable/filterable/paginated view.\n\nUI & Security Requirements:\n- Tables with **search, sorting, and pagination** + filters.\n- Confirmation dialogs (`ConfirmDialog`) for destructive actions.\n- Clear validation messages.\n- Draft / published / archived content states + **preview before publishing**.\n- Backend enforcement of admin permissions (`requireAuth` + `requireRole(\'admin\')`) on every admin route.\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed in Step 10 (Partial Batch 1)\n1. **`/server/db/schema.ts`** \342\200\224 **DONE**:\n   - Added `CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS activity_versions` (with `UNIQUE (activity_id, version_number)` + index `idx_activity_versions_act`).\n   - Added `CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS admin_audit_logs` (with index `idx_admin_audit_created`).\n   - Added idempotent `ensureColumn` migrations:\n     - `users.reviewer_allowed_age_groups_json TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT \'[]\'`\n     - `users.reviewer_specialty_note TEXT`\n     - `activities.objectives_json TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT \'[]\'`\n     - `activities.instructional_video_url TEXT`\n   - Added automatic backfill of initial `v1` snapshots into `activity_versions` for any existing activities lacking one.\n2. **`/src/shared/types.ts`** \342\200\224 **PARTIALLY DONE**:\n   - Chunk 1 **APPLIED**: Added `UnifiedAuditCategory`, `UnifiedAuditLogItem`, `AdminAgeGroupItem`, `AdminDomainItem`, `AdminReviewerItem`, `AdminSubmissionItem`, `AdminUserItem`, and extended `AdminOverviewResponse` (`draftActivities`, `archivedActivities`, `totalChildren`, `pendingReviews`, `completedReviews`, `recentActivity`).\n   - Chunk 0 **NOT APPLIED YET** (line range mismatch): Still need to add `objectives?: string[]` and `instructionalVideoUrl?: string | null` to `ActivitySummary`, AND add `ActivityVersionSnapshot` interface!\n\n### Skills Read\n- Read `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`, `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/6_education_simulations.md`, and `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/3_saas_dashboard.md`.\n- Previously read `/skills/system_skills/securecoder_persona/SKILL.md`.\n\n### Still Remaining for Step 10\n- **NOT YET EDITED**:\n  1. `/src/shared/types.ts` (finish chunk 0: `ActivitySummary.objectives`, `ActivitySummary.instructionalVideoUrl`, `ActivityVersionSnapshot`).\n  2. `/server/repositories/index.ts` (all Step 10 admin repository methods, `activity_versions` snapshot saving, `logAdminAudit`, `listUnifiedAuditLogs`, age group/domain/reviewer/submission/user/daily-plan CRUD).\n  3. `/server/routes/api.ts` (all `/api/v1/admin/*` endpoints strictly behind `requireAuth` + `requireRole(\'admin\')` + Zod validation).\n  4. `/src/lib/api.ts` (typed client methods for all 9 admin modules).\n  5. `/src/pages/admin/AdminDataTable.tsx` (reusable search, sort, pagination table).\n  6. `/src/pages/admin/AdminActivityManager.tsx` (full Activity + Rubric CRUD, Objectives, Video URL, Preview-before-publishing Modal, Version History Modal, Archive/Delete ConfirmDialog).\n  7. `/src/pages/admin/AdminSecondaryModules.tsx` (Age Groups, Domains, Daily Plans, Reviewers, Submissions, Users, Unified Audit Logs).\n  8. `/src/pages/AdminConsoleView.tsx` & `/src/App.tsx` (9-module sidebar admin workspace + Dashboard overview).\n  9. **NOT YET COMPILED, LINTED, RESTARTED, OR E2E TESTED** for Step 10.\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- `src/App.tsx` currently mounts `<AdminConsoleView activeTab={adminTab} />` wrapped in `<TopBar>` with 4 legacy tabs (`curriculum`, `plans`, `users`, `privacy`). Upgrading `AdminConsoleView` to own a dedicated desktop left sidebar + compact mobile drawer (mirroring `ParentDashboardView`) with all 9 admin modules + Sign Out & Design System links makes navigation much cleaner and satisfies the 3-zone top-bar / sidebar workspace contract without cramming 9 links into a horizontal bar.\n- In `/server/repositories/index.ts`:\n  - `saveActivity(...)` already increments `activities.version = COALESCE(version, 1) + 1` on update and preserves existing `activity_rubric_criteria` IDs when referenced by `review_rubric_scores`. We must enhance it to:\n    1. Persist `objectives_json`, `prep_level`, and `instructional_video_url`.\n    2. Insert an immutable snapshot row into `activity_versions` on BOTH create (`v1`) and update (`vN`), recording `change_note` and `created_by`.\n    3. Log an entry into `admin_audit_logs` (`activity_created` / `activity_updated` / `activity_archived` / `activity_deleted`).\n  - `listActivities(...)` and `getActivityDetail(...)` must map `objectives: JSON.parse(row.objectives_json || \'[]\')` and `instructionalVideoUrl: row.instructional_video_url ?? null`.\n- `video_submissions` already has `activity_version INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 1` stored at submission time, so existing submissions stay permanently linked to the exact version used when submitted!\n- Seeded demo accounts (password `LittleSteps123!`):\n  - Parent: `meera@littlesteps.in`\n  - Reviewer: `ananya.reviewer@littlesteps.in`\n  - Admin: `kavita.admin@littlesteps.in`\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- **Resolved earlier**:\n  - Step 8: Aligned `review_audit_history` SQL columns (`actor_role`, `score_pct`, `summary_note`) with `ReviewHistoryEntry` type; E2E verified.\n  - Step 9: Corrected `repo.findChildByIdForParent` method name in `server/routes/api.ts`; E2E verified.\n- **Unresolved minor edit miss in Step 10**:\n  - Chunk 0 of `multi_replace_file_content` on `/src/shared/types.ts` failed (`target content not found in file`) because `ActivitySummary` line numbers shifted slightly from earlier edits. Fix: view lines 95\342\200\223150 of `/src/shared/types.ts` first, then apply the clean replacement.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Dev server runs on port `3000` (`tsx server.ts`).\n- SQLite DB is at `./data/littlesteps.db`; schema migrations run automatically on `restart_dev_server`.\n- Generated images in `/src/assets/images/`:\n  - `hero_montessori_play_1795191199446.jpg`\n  - `activity_sensory_linen_1795191186954.jpg`\n  - `activity_tummy_mirror_1795191186302.jpg`\n  - `activity_everyday_cup_1795191187309.jpg`\n  - `progress_journey_illustration_1795236568060.jpg`\n\n## 6. Next Steps (In Priority Order)\n1. **Finish `/src/shared/types.ts`**:\n   - View lines 95\342\200\223155 of `/src/shared/types.ts`.\n   - Add `objectives?: string[]` and `instructionalVideoUrl?: string | null` to `ActivitySummary`, and add the `ActivityVersionSnapshot` interface.\n\n2. **Update `/server/repositories/index.ts`**:\n   - Import the new Step 10 types (`ActivityVersionSnapshot`, `AdminAgeGroupItem`, `AdminDomainItem`, `AdminReviewerItem`, `AdminSubmissionItem`, `AdminUserItem`, `UnifiedAuditLogItem`, `UnifiedAuditCategory`).\n   - Add `logAdminAudit(params: { actorUserId, actorRole, action, entityType, entityId, summary, metadata? })`.\n   - Add `listUnifiedAuditLogs(filters?: { category?: UnifiedAuditCategory | \'all\'; limit?: number }): UnifiedAuditLogItem[]` combining `admin_audit_logs`, `review_audit_history`, and `media_access_audit_logs` ordered by `createdAt DESC`.\n   - Update `getAdminOverview(lastRetentionSweepAt)` to include `draftActivities`, `archivedActivities`, `totalChildren`, `pendingReviews` (`queued` + `in_review`), `completedReviews` (`reviewed`), and `recentActivity: this.listUnifiedAuditLogs({ limit: 12 })`.\n   - Add Age Group & Domain management methods:\n     - `listAdminAgeGroups(): AdminAgeGroupItem[]`\n     - `saveAgeGroup(actorUserId, payload: { id?: string; slug: string; label: string; minMonths: number; maxMonths: number; sortOrder: number }): AdminAgeGroupItem`\n     - `listAdminDomains(): AdminDomainItem[]`\n     - `saveDomain(actorUserId, payload: { id?: string; slug: string; name: string; description: string; sortOrder: number }): AdminDomainItem`\n   - Upgrade Activity methods:\n     - Map `objectives` and `instructionalVideoUrl` in `listActivities` & `getActivityDetail` (and support `status` filter `\'all\' | \'draft\' | \'published\' | \'archived\'`).\n     - Update `saveActivity` to accept `objectives?: string[]`, `prepLevel?: ActivityPrepLevel`, `instructionalVideoUrl?: string | null`, `changeNote?: string | null`, write a snapshot to `activity_versions` on both create and update, and call `logAdminAudit`.\n     - Add `listActivityVersions(activityId: string): ActivityVersionSnapshot[]` (joining `users` for `createdByName` and counting `video_submissions` linked to each `(activity_id, activity_version)`!).\n     - Add `updateActivityStatus(actorUserId, activityId, status: ActivityStatus): ActivityDetail | null` (for quick Archive / Publish / Draft actions with audit logging).\n     - Update `deleteActivity` to prevent deleting activities that already have `video_submissions` (suggest archiving instead!) and log to `admin_audit_logs`.\n   - Add `deleteDailyPlan(actorUserId, planId: string): boolean` + log `daily_plan_saved` inside `upsertDailyPlan`.\n   - Add Reviewer & User management methods:\n     - `listAdminReviewers(): AdminReviewerItem[]`\n     - `createReviewerAccount(actorUserId, payload: { email, fullName, passwordHash, allowedAgeGroupSlugs, specialtyNote }): AdminReviewerItem`\n     - `updateReviewerPermissions(actorUserId, reviewerId, payload: { isActive?, allowedAgeGroupSlugs?, specialtyNote? }): AdminReviewerItem | null`\n     - `listAdminUsers(): AdminUserItem[]` (including `childrenCount`, `submissionsCount`, `completedReviewsCount`, `allowedAgeGroupSlugs`, `specialtyNote`)\n     - Enhance `updateUserRoleAndStatus` to prevent demoting/deactivating the last active admin and log to `admin_audit_logs`.\n   - Add Submission management methods:\n     - `listAdminSubmissions(filters?: { status?, ageGroupSlug? }): AdminSubmissionItem[]`\n     - `assignSubmissionReviewer(actorUserId, submissionId, reviewerUserId: string | null): AdminSubmissionItem | null` (validates reviewer role & active status, logs to `admin_audit_logs`).\n\n3. **Update `/server/routes/api.ts`** (ALL gated by `requireAuth` + `requireRole(\'admin\')`):\n   - Extend `adminActivitySchema` with `objectives: z.array(z.string().min(1).max(200)).max(8).optional().default([])`, `prepLevel: z.enum([\'no_prep\', \'quick_setup\', \'guided_prep\']).optional().default(\'quick_setup\')`, `instructionalVideoUrl: z.string().url().or(z.literal(\'\')).optional().nullable()`, `changeNote: z.string().max(300).optional().nullable()`.\n   - Add routes:\n     - `GET /admin/age-groups`, `POST /admin/age-groups`, `PUT /admin/age-groups/:id`\n     - `GET /admin/domains`, `POST /admin/domains`, `PUT /admin/domains/:id`\n     - `GET /admin/activities/:id/versions`\n     - `PATCH /admin/activities/:id/status` (quick publish/draft/archive)\n     - `DELETE /admin/daily-plans/:id`\n     - `GET /admin/reviewers`, `POST /admin/reviewers` (hashes password with `hashPassword`), `PATCH /admin/reviewers/:id`\n     - `GET /admin/submissions`, `PATCH /admin/submissions/:id/assign`\n     - Update `GET /admin/users` to return `AdminUserItem[]` & `PATCH /admin/users/:id/role` to log admin audit + prevent removing last active admin.\n     - Update `GET /admin/audit-logs` to return `{ unifiedLogs, logs, lastRetentionSweepAt }` supporting `?category=all|admin|review|media`.\n     - Log admin audit when running `POST /admin/retention/run` or admin `DELETE /submissions/:id/video`.\n\n4. **Update `/src/lib/api.ts`**:\n   - Add all typed client methods for the 9 admin modules (`getAdminAgeGroups`, `saveAdminAgeGroup`, `getAdminDomains`, `saveAdminDomain`, `getAdminActivityVersions`, `updateAdminActivityStatus`, `deleteAdminDailyPlan`, `getAdminReviewers`, `createAdminReviewer`, `updateAdminReviewer`, `getAdminSubmissions`, `assignAdminSubmission`, updated `getAdminAuditLogs`, updated `saveAdminActivity`).\n\n5. **Build Modular Admin UI Components**:\n   - `/src/pages/admin/AdminDataTable.tsx`: Generic accessible table with search input, sortable column headers, page size (`10` / `20` / `50`), pagination controls (`Previous` / `Next` + `Showing X\342\200\223Y of Z`), empty state, and loading skeleton.\n   - `/src/pages/admin/AdminActivityManager.tsx`:\n     - Filter bar (age group, domain, status: `all`/`draft`/`published`/`archived`) + searchable/sortable/paginated activities table showing Title, Version (`vN`), Age Group, Domain, Status, Duration, and actions (`Edit`, `Versions`, `Archive`/`Publish`, `Delete`).\n     - Full Activity Editor form: Age group, domain, status (`draft`/`published`/`archived`), title, summary, **objectives** (line-by-line), duration, prep level, materials, poster selector + **instructional video URL**, safety guidelines, dynamic steps builder, dynamic weighted rubric builder (live 100-pt validator + clear inline error messages), optional version change note.\n     - **Preview Before Publishing Modal**: Renders parent-facing activity preview (poster/video, objectives, materials, safety box, steps, rubric breakdown) with `\"Confirm & Publish\"` CTA!\n     - **Version History Modal**: Displays all preserved snapshots (`v1`, `v2`, ...) with timestamps, author, change notes, linked submissions count, and expandable details of prior steps & rubric criteria!\n     - `ConfirmDialog` for Archive & Delete actions.\n   - `/src/pages/admin/AdminSecondaryModules.tsx`:\n     - **Age Group Management** (searchable/sortable table + Create/Edit modal).\n     - **Development Domain Management** (searchable/sortable table + Create/Edit modal).\n     - **Daily Plan Management** (age group selector, existing day cards, editor with 1\342\200\2234 published activities, delete plan with `ConfirmDialog`).\n     - **Reviewer Management** (table with search/sort/pagination, Create Reviewer modal, Edit Permissions modal for active toggle + permitted age groups + specialty note).\n     - **Submission Management** (searchable/sortable/filterable/paginated table showing `PAR-XXXXXX`, Activity & linked `vN`, Age Group, Status, Assigned Reviewer dropdown/reassign modal, Score/Not Assessable, Expiry, Inspect Detail modal with `SecureVideoPlayer`, Delete Video with `ConfirmDialog`).\n     - **User Management** (searchable/sortable/filterable/paginated table of parents, reviewers, admins; Role selector & Activate/Deactivate with `ConfirmDialog`).\n     - **Audit Logs** (searchable/sortable/filterable/paginated unified log table with category filter `All` / `Admin` / `Review` / `Media`, plus Manual 30-Day Retention Sweep button).\n   - `/src/pages/AdminConsoleView.tsx` & `/src/App.tsx`:\n     - Dedicated 9-module Montessori-editorial desktop left sidebar (`Dashboard`, `Age Groups`, `Domains`, `Activities`, `Daily Plans`, `Reviewers`, `Submissions`, `Users`, `Audit Logs`) + mobile drawer + clean top bar with breadcrumb & Sign Out.\n     - **Dashboard module**: 6 KPI cards (`Total Parents`, `Total Children`, `Total Activities`, `Pending Reviews`, `Completed Reviews`, `Active Videos`), 8\303\2276 Curriculum Coverage Matrix, and Recent Platform Activity feed.\n\n6. **Verify End-to-End**:\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit` must pass with 0 errors).\n   - Run `restart_dev_server` so SQLite schema migrations (`activity_versions`, `admin_audit_logs`, backfill) execute cleanly.\n   - Run an exhaustive Step 10 E2E API test script verifying:\n     1. Strict backend RBAC: parent & reviewer receive `403` on all new `/admin/*` endpoints.\n     2. `GET /admin/overview` returns `totalParents`, `totalChildren`, `totalActivities`, `pendingReviews`, `completedReviews`, and `recentActivity`.\n     3. Age Group & Domain management read & update + audit log entry.\n     4. Activity lifecycle & **content versioning**: Create `draft` activity with objectives & video URL (`v1`) -> publish (`v2`) -> verify `GET /admin/activities/:id/versions` preserves both `v1` and `v2`! -> upload a parent submission linked to `v2` -> edit activity rubric (`v3`) -> verify existing submission stays linked to `activityVersion === 2` while activity is at `v3` and `activity_versions` preserves `v1`, `v2`, `v3`! -> archive activity (`archived`).\n     5. Reviewer creation & permission update -> verify new reviewer appears in `/admin/reviewers` and can be assigned to a submission via `PATCH /admin/submissions/:id/assign`.\n     6. User management self-deactivation protection (`400`).\n     7. Unified `GET /admin/audit-logs` captures admin, review, and media actions.\n     8. Clean up all temporary test entities so demo data remains pristine.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Strict TypeScript (`strict: true`), Tailwind CSS v4 (`@import \"tailwindcss\";`), warm Montessori editorial tokens, WCAG 2.2 AA contrast, `>= 44px` touch targets, zero-pill static metadata, tabular numerals (`font-mono tabular-nums`), single-elevation hairline cards.\n- Never use `window.alert`, `window.confirm`, or `window.open` (use `ConfirmDialog` and `Modal`).\n- Never claim completion until `compile_applet`, `lint_applet`, `restart_dev_server`, and live E2E verification all pass.\n- Include 2\342\200\2233 concise plain-language security safeguard bullets in the final chat response without internal security branding or jargon.\n</summary>"
